<h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">False Ceiling Designs &amp; Lighting Layouts</h3>
<p class="text-muted">Our false ceilings utilize Gyproc gypsum boards, integrated with indirect cove lighting and adjustable spotlights to create a luxury visual flow.</p>
<p class="text-muted">These track lighting systems allow you to slide, rotate, or exchange spotlight panels according to your furniture layout shifts, giving you total flexibility. We integrate automated dimming controllers to let you switch between bright functional light and cozy warm ambient settings with a click.</p>
<h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Why Choose Us as Your Local Panvel Designers</h3>
<p class="text-muted">Homeowners in Panvel choose us for our single-point contracting responsibility and transparent BOQ billing. We coordinate all civil permits and provide a 10-year durability warranty on all structural woodwork.</p>
